        "title": "Jeremiah's Judgment Against Egypt",
        "introduction": "Jeremiah's prophetic ministry extends not only to Judah but also to foreign nations which have been Judah's oppressors. Judah's most recent threat has been from Egypt, but the time is near for Egypt to reap its just reward. Here are Jeremiah's warnings to Egypt, as well as to the Philistines, who will be Egypt's last victim in this era of power."
